('S-04','Invoice marked Paid by employee','Vertical authorization','Invoices / POST /api/v2/invoices/:id/transition','Employee session','Medium','High',
 'Only managers may approve; only admins may mark Paid.','Transition to Paid only checks organization membership.',
 'Compare transition responses across roles for each target state.','Invoice status Paid set by an employee account.',
 'Fraudulent settlement of invoices.','Role gate every transition server-side using a transition/role matrix.',NULL),
('S-05','Invoice line items across tenants','Cross-tenant authorization','Invoices / GET /api/v2/invoices/:id/items','Foreign invoice id (see chain B)','Medium','High',
 'Line items are returned only for invoices in the caller organization.','Items endpoint filters by invoice id only.',
 'Obtain an invoice id from another tenant and request /items.','Line items and prices for another tenant invoice.',
