 'Script-capable markup executing in a second session (synthetic).','Session actions performed in victim context.','Render as text or sanitize with an allow-list.',NULL),
('S-09','Search term reflected into page','Reflected client-side rendering','Search / ?q=','Any member','Easy','Medium',
